itorios\nsuelo de<o:p></o:p></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\nmadera. Cuenta con calefacción y aire acondicionado y su\nmobiliario es de<o:p></o:p></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\nestilo mejicano, salpicado con algún mueble antiguo local.<o:p></o:p></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<img alt=\"Casa El Alarife\" height=\"263\" src=\"http://img.turispain.com/empresas/4263000/4263184/galeria/casa_el_alarife_casas_rurales_4263184_1.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<img alt=\"Imagen principal\" height=\"263\" src=\"http://img.turispain.com/empresas/4263000/4263184/galeria/casa_el_alarife_casas_rurales_4263184_2.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\">\n<img alt=\"Imagen principal\" height=\"263\" src=\"http://img.turispain.com/empresas/4263000/4263184/galeria/casa_el_alarife_casas_rurales_4263184_4.jpg\" width=\"320\" /></div>\n<br />\nPUEDE VER LOS ALREDEDORES DEL ALOJAMIENTO MOVIENDOSE POR LA IMAGEN<br />\n<iframe frameborder=\"0\" height=\"350\" marginheight=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" src=\"https://maps.google.es/maps?f=q&amp;source=embed&amp;hl=es&amp;geocode=&amp;q=CASA+RURAL+EL+ALARIFE+SEDILES+&amp;aq=&amp;sll=42.048576,-0.910642&amp;sspn=0.008907,0.021136&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=CASA+RURAL+EL+ALARIFE&amp;hnear=Sediles,+Zaragoza,+Arag%C3%B3n&amp;ll=41.346309,-1.529568&amp;spn=0.006295,0.006295&amp;t=m&amp;layer=c&amp;cbll=41.346287,-1.529452&amp;panoid=Dc7JHSLYRdPf6IvJmm8Vng&amp;cbp=12,9.19,,0,0&amp;output=svembed\" width=\"425\"></iframe><br />\n<small><a href=\"https://maps.google.es/maps?f=q&amp;source=embed&amp;hl=es&amp;geocode=&amp;q=CASA+RURAL+EL+ALARIFE+SEDILES+&amp;aq=&amp;sll=42.048576,-0.910642&amp;sspn=0.008907,0.021136&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;hq=CASA+RURAL+EL+ALARIFE&amp;hnear=Sediles,+Zaragoza,+Arag%C3%B3n&amp;ll=41.346309,-1.529568&amp;spn=0.006295,0.006295&amp;t=m&amp;layer=c&amp;cbll=4